    <briefdescription>
<para>The error handling API supports checking the error status of <ref refid="namespacePDI" kindref="compound">PDI</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, errors in <ref refid="namespacePDI" kindref="compound">PDI</ref> C API are signaled by a return code of type <ref refid="group__error_1ga838ed1a4a5ca21c0d3ef790afbf61b74" kindref="member">PDI_status_t</ref> and an error message can be retrieved with the PDI_errmsg function. This default behavior can be changed by replacing the error handler with the PDI_errhandler function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
